1
00:00:00,795 --> 00:00:03,175
So we start the game over
until there's a winner.

2
00:00:03,339 --> 00:00:05,509
(Leonard:)There wasn't ever going to be a winner.

3
00:00:05,675 --> 00:00:07,635
There was going to be a selfish person...

4
00:00:07,802 --> 00:00:09,972
(Leonard:)...and three people
who used to be his friend.

5
00:00:10,138 --> 00:00:12,308
Is that what you guys want? If it is, fine.

6
00:00:12,473 --> 00:00:14,933
(Leonard:)I don't want anything to do with you.

7
00:00:15,268 --> 00:00:18,438
(Leonard:)I don't know what happened
in that bathroom, but I'm not cleaning it.

8
00:00:35,371 --> 00:00:37,711
(Sheldon:)My precious.

9
00:00:55,224 --> 00:00:57,564
(Sheldon:)I knew it.

10
00:01:00,354 --> 00:01:03,524
(Sheldon:)-Give us the precious.
-Never! Never.

11
00:01:03,691 --> 00:01:05,111
-Give it to me.
-Get off of me.

12
00:01:05,276 --> 00:01:06,406
(Sheldon:)-Give me the ring.
-It's mine.

13
00:01:06,569 --> 00:01:07,649
[PENNY GROANS]

14
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,700
I gotta go back to dating dumb guys
from the gym.

15
00:01:09,864 --> 00:01:13,494
-Give it back.
-Give it to me. Give me the ring!

16
00:01:13,659 --> 00:01:17,209
-I said give it to me.
-It's mine!

